<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - EDS cut by Cowen.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - EDS cut by Cowen.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cowen &amp; Co said it downgraded Electronic Data Systems Corp to underperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- After the market closed on Thursday, EDS said it expected an erosion of revenues and earnings to deflate 1997 earnings to a range of $1.90 to $2.00 a share.</p>
<p>-- EDS lost 6-6/16 to 36-3/4.</p>
</text>
